WARNO.exe+A13A31: 48 83 7C 24 38 00  - cmp qword ptr [rsp+38],00
WARNO.exe+A13A37: 0F 85 10 01 00 00  - jne WARNO.exe+A13B4D
WARNO.exe+A13A3D: E9 0C 02 00 00     - jmp WARNO.exe+A13C4E
// ---------- INJECTING HERE ----------
