WARNO.exe+A13A54: 48 85 ED           - test rbp,rbp
WARNO.exe+A13A57: 0F 84 C1 00 00 00  - je WARNO.exe+A13B1E
WARNO.exe+A13A5D: 48 89 5C 24 40     - mov [rsp+40],rbx
